  "decision_summary": "Noscapine is a phthalideisoquinoline alkaloid with recognized CNS activity; multiple structurally related isoquinoline/protoberberine/porphine alkaloids show direct brain/CSF penetration, and noscapine itself is known to cross the BBB and is under evaluation for glioma. Therefore meaningful CNS access is predicted.",
